WEBVTT

00:06:26.958 --> 00:06:31.767
but we would never ever
say the word out loud in class.

00:06:32.871 --> 00:06:34.604
Nobody ever said it again.

00:06:34.966 --> 00:06:37.232
But they didn't learn much either.

00:06:38.427 --> 00:06:40.260
Afterwards, what bothered me most

00:06:40.284 --> 00:06:42.458
was that I didn't even explain to students

00:06:42.482 --> 00:06:47.141
why, of all the vile, problematic words
in American English,

00:06:47.165 --> 00:06:51.236
why this particular word
had its own buffer,

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.527
the surrogate phrase "the N-word."

00:06:54.149 --> 00:06:56.262
Most of my students,

00:06:56.286 --> 00:07:00.390
many of them born
in the late 1990s and afterwards,